# Crystal Imperium play test: the rematch and postgame bosses (DECISIONS.md D47)
# Every boss whose team was Heart & Soul's own until 0.15.0 (the Johto leaders' and the Elite
# Four's rematches, every postgame rematch, the rival's last two battles, Elder Li) loads
# with its whole team at the cap of its stage and plays to a result against the prepared six
# with care-package items at that cap (naive play: the wins aren't counted).
# gEnemyParty: 100 bytes a Pokemon, level at +84; gEnemyPartyCount is the team size.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!no_care_packages()
savestate base.ss

# Stage 0: cap 15
loadstate base.ss
!prepared_team(15, items=True)
savestate cap15.ss
loadstate cap15.ss
!battle("TRAINER_LI_HNS")
waituntil32 {gBattlerControllerFuncs} {HandleInputChooseAction@battle_controller_player} 4000 B li_action_menu
expect8 {gEnemyPartyCount} 3 li_has_3
expect8 {gEnemyParty+84} 15 li_lead_at_15
expect8 {gEnemyParty+284} 15 li_last_at_15
!autobattle("0,0,0,0,0,0")
expectne8 {gBattleOutcome} 0 li_resolved

